    <description>it is a C# library that i designed using . Net 9.0. it performs calculations for (Earth center) models from Al-biruni Al-buzjani, Ibn-bajja and Newton (etc)..</description>
    <tags>distance-calculation, math-engine, physics-engine, navigation, csharp, dotnet9, kinematics</tags>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/Mohamed1234mmb/GeoKinematics" branch="refs/heads/main" commit="a04c2d399a06f542fd70de934ed3629517b563fd" />
